{"track":"python","category":"문자열·리스트","level":3,"title":"쉼표로 구분된 숫자의 합","desc":"<p><code>\"1,2,3\"</code> 처럼 쉼표로 구분된 정수 문자열의 합을 돌려주는 <code>sum_csv(s)</code>를 만드세요. 음수도 있을 수 있어요.</p>","starter":"def sum_csv(s):\n    pass\n","solution":"def sum_csv(s):\n    return sum(int(x) for x in s.split(\",\"))\n","hint":"<p><code>split(\",\")</code> 으로 나눈 뒤 <code>int()</code>로 바꿔 더해요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"sum_csv(\"1,2,3\")","expected":6,"visible":true},{"call":"sum_csv(\"10,-5,7\")","expected":12,"visible":true},{"call":"sum_csv(\"42\")","expected":42,"visible":false},{"call":"sum_csv(\"0,0\")","expected":0,"visible":false}],"id":"py-053"}